WEBVTT

e13c8b24-c3b3-414c-aff1-6505695f6d23-0
00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:09.960
You can test for a 200% and 400% browser
zoom by going through the following steps.

b9025768-c3af-449b-ae40-6dd3a9b25aa8-0
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.664
First, on Mac,
click the Apple icon and go to System

b9025768-c3af-449b-ae40-6dd3a9b25aa8-1
00:00:14.664 --> 00:00:20.262
Settings to open the System Settings
window if it's not already open and

b9025768-c3af-449b-ae40-6dd3a9b25aa8-2
00:00:20.262 --> 00:00:21.719
search for Display.

57b4b6c1-0f4f-491b-9e63-38e1bf552a17-0
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:32.188
Uh, on the display screen,
find the screen dimensions that are

57b4b6c1-0f4f-491b-9e63-38e1bf552a17-1
00:00:32.188 --> 00:00:34.440
closest to 1280 by 1024.

d2644f8c-bc51-480e-9f56-387dcd83f73f-0
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.040
On my machine that would be 1312 by 1848.

7686608a-605c-4dfb-9637-f48e8ea9a0df-0
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:46.067
And then in the browser of your choice,
whether it's Chrome, Safari, or Edge,

7686608a-605c-4dfb-9637-f48e8ea9a0df-1
00:00:46.067 --> 00:00:51.910
first check that you are starting from
the default browser zoom so you can click

7686608a-605c-4dfb-9637-f48e8ea9a0df-2
00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:52.560
on the...

e6513858-43d5-4795-8045-48c6a2bbcf09-0
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:53.400
vertical...

efe00f94-396a-4c61-b320-aa8197c57604-0
00:00:53.400 --> 00:01:01.473
Button and in the Systems options menu,
find the zoom option and here we see that

efe00f94-396a-4c61-b320-aa8197c57604-1
00:01:01.473 --> 00:01:04.920
it is at 100% which is the default.

bb389ed8-d241-439a-9742-2fa6f1f704cf-0
00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:12.356
We can select the plus icon and continue
to press it until we reach 200%,

bb389ed8-d241-439a-9742-2fa6f1f704cf-1
00:01:12.356 --> 00:01:18.701
and then we can take inventory of items
on the screen to make sure that there is

bb389ed8-d241-439a-9742-2fa6f1f704cf-2
00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:22.383
no overlap of content,
no content is obscured,

bb389ed8-d241-439a-9742-2fa6f1f704cf-3
00:01:22.383 --> 00:01:25.360
and there is no loss of functionality.

921e5fab-d38b-4362-a252-9e1c94201fc2-0
00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.782
So here on the T-Mobile device search
page,

921e5fab-d38b-4362-a252-9e1c94201fc2-1
00:01:28.782 --> 00:01:32.440
I see that all my content and
functionality is retained.

dd2313d8-e918-4a3e-9210-a0d4e64d3fc8-0
00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:37.760
All of my headings, links, form fields,
and buttons remain available.

c7b3d026-4610-4fcc-9b13-6f450ec112a2-0
00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:44.380
I can also tab through each button link
in form field to get the primary focus

c7b3d026-4610-4fcc-9b13-6f450ec112a2-1
00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:47.200
outline on all of the available items.

4aaedad7-3145-434b-9b3c-7fbf4d44304e-0
00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:52.320
Similarly, if I go back to the vertical...

7bf48c57-e347-4405-bcbc-b2911949b11d-0
00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:54.720
Button to change the zoom level.

4caf5092-525e-426c-ba34-4a64de348982-0
00:01:55.640 --> 00:02:02.275
I can find zoom again and continually
press the plus icon or plus button to

4caf5092-525e-426c-ba34-4a64de348982-1
00:02:02.275 --> 00:02:03.760
increase to 400%.

3186ab6b-6950-4d15-992b-38cc5f1a6a0a-0
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:09.560
Here I see that my text has scaled up
significantly.

8331df51-83cb-41e1-97cd-ed39a21f2eaa-0
00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.920
I still have the majority of my content.

da2f61ba-46ad-428d-936b-70a5be297674-0
00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:19.250
One note here,
previously filters was in a list of

da2f61ba-46ad-428d-936b-70a5be297674-1
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:27.030
options with accordions and now the
filters has fallen under menu that can

da2f61ba-46ad-428d-936b-70a5be297674-2
00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:29.520
launch the filter modal.

769b5e1f-3f3c-4f6e-8625-c5f6a00e6ba8-0
00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:36.854
So here again I have options to access
all of my filter controls and this has

769b5e1f-3f3c-4f6e-8625-c5f6a00e6ba8-1
00:02:36.854 --> 00:02:39.720
been a test of 200% and 400% zoom.